B.wB=new A.cU("Do I need to install anything?","No. MyFitWellness runs in your browser on phone and desktop, and keeps you signed in on the device you use.")
B.Ma=new A.cU("Do I need a code from my gym?","No. Pick your gym from the directory or type its name \u2014 your account remembers it, and you can change it later from Account.")
B.Me=new A.cU("Can I try it without creating an account?",u.R)
B.M9=new A.cU("How long does setup take?","About three minutes: create an account, choose your gym, and today's workout is already waiting. Nothing else to configure before your first checkmark.")
B.Ex=s([B.wB,B.Ma,B.Me,B.M9],t.bb)
B.LZ=new A.nR("Getting started",B.Ex)
B.M8=new A.cU("How do streaks work?","Every exercise you tick adds to today's progress, and every finished session fills in a day on the week view. The home screen shows the current streak \u2014 the demo starts with six days behind it.")
B.M6=new A.cU("What is the stopwatch for?","It times a set and records the weight and reps with it. Those entries build your session history, so you can look back at what you actually lifted instead of estimating.")
B.Mg=new A.cU("Can I add exercises that aren't in my plan?","Yes. Add your own exercises to the daily list from the workout screen, then tick them off like the rest of the session.")
B.Mf=new A.cU("What happens if I lose signal mid-workout?","The app keeps working from what is already on your device. Checkmarks and entries sync back to your account when the connection returns, so a basement gym doesn't cost you the session.")
B.Md=new A.cU("Who answers in coach chat?","Messages go to the trainer or nutritionist thread on your account. Trainers cover form, programming and recovery; Coach Amara covers sports nutrition. The reply lands in the same conversation.")
B.M4=new A.cU("Can I track goals other than weight?","Yes \u2014 weight, distance, strength or anything else you can measure. Give a goal a start value and a target, then update the current number as you go.")
B.Ft=s([B.M8,B.M6,B.Mg,B.Mf,B.Md,B.M4],t.bb)
B.LX=new A.nR("Using the app",B.Ft)
B.wA=new A.cU("What happens to my data if I switch devices?","Your account lives on the server, so workouts, goals, plan and messages follow you. Sign in on any browser to pick up where you left off.")
B.Mc=new A.cU("Is the demo account private?","No \u2014 the demo credentials are published on this site, so treat it as a shared sandbox. Create your own account if you want your workouts and messages to belong only to you.")
B.M7=new A.cU("How do I sign out?","Use sign out in Account \u2192 Settings. The session token is revoked on the server, so the device can't keep using it.")
B.M3=new A.cU("Do I keep my history if I cancel Premium?","Yes. Cancelling moves you back to General, re-locks Premium features right away, and leaves your workouts, goals and history intact.")
B.Fg=s([B.wA,B.Mc,B.M7,B.M3],t.bb)
B.LY=new A.nR("Your account and data",B.Fg)
B.M0=new A.cU("How much do the plans cost?","General is $4.99/month or $49/year. Premium is $14.99/month or $149/year. Both are cancel-anytime, and Premium includes everything in General.")
B.M2=new A.cU("What exactly does Premium unlock?","Coach chat, nutritionist chat, personalised meal plans, the advanced video library and coaching sessions. General keeps the daily tracking, streaks, goals, history and standard videos.")
B.M5=new A.cU("Can I switch between plans or billing cadence?","Yes \u2014 switch between General and Premium, or between monthly and annual, from Account \u2192 Subscription. Annual plans run twelve months from the day you start.")
B.Mh=new A.cU("Is there a free trial?","There isn't a countdown trial. The demo is free to use without paying, and General is the paid plan when you want your own account and history.")
B.F0=s([B.M0,B.M2,B.M5,B.Mh],t.bb)
B.LW=new A.nR("Plans and billing",B.F0)
B.m_=s([B.LZ,B.LX,B.LY,B.LW],A.ao("w<nR>"))
